---
title: A mutating Git command from admission to observed completion (implemented, push shown)
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Caller as Caller (UI, tool, run)
  participant GW as Gateway (AdmittedCommand)
  participant GS as GitService (CommandHandler)
  participant AP as Approvals (owner_preview)
  participant Store as ApplicationStore
  participant Q as Dispatcher (git_effects Consumer)
  participant Fx as Effects then GitService.execute
  participant PT as PushTransport
  participant Files as GitTransportFiles
  participant Git as git process (HelperRunner)
  Caller->>GW: git.push { worktreeId, remoteId, targetRef, expectedHead, mode }
  GW->>GS: prepare (outside any store snapshot)
  GS->>Git: read-only observation of source and registered destination
  GS->>PT: push_transport reads git config, refuses executable helpers
  PT->>Files: create(isolated config) returns private directory
  PT-->>GS: digest of program, config and environment
  GW->>GS: decide inside one write transaction
  opt a reviewed operation exists
    GS->>AP: approved_binding then recheck_control
    AP-->>GS: reviewed facts, SourceChanged if any differ
  end
  alt non-human caller, no review, local-server remote
    GS-->>Caller: refused ApprovalRequired (git_local_server_review)
  else force push to a protected branch or no expected remote
    GS-->>Caller: refused PermissionDenied (protected_branch)
  else binding matches
    GS->>Store: record_intent(Job) + reserve worktree pending_operation_id
    GS->>Store: append event + enqueue git_effects entry (partition = worktree)
    GS-->>Caller: Accepted { operationId }
  end
  Q->>Fx: execute(OperationRecord) via spawn_blocking
  Fx->>Fx: verify_target (physical repository and worktree identity)
  Fx->>PT: push_transport again, digest must equal the decided digest
  Fx->>Git: remote symbolic ref, default branch, remote head (lease check)
  alt remote lease stale or local source changed
    Fx-->>Q: Unknown or Failed, reservation kept or settled by settle_denial
  else checks pass
    Fx->>Git: push --porcelain --force-with-lease=target:observed (isolated GIT_DIR, no system or global config)
    Fx->>Git: re-read remote head, never repeat the write
    alt remote head equals expected head
      Fx->>Store: finish_git: update worktree, clear pending, event, links (one unit of work)
      Fx-->>Q: Completed(result GitPush)
    else not observed
      Fx-->>Q: Unknown (observe later, never replayed)
    end
  end
  PT->>Files: drop context removes the private directory
  Note over Q,Fx: after a crash, observe reads the worktree checkpoint, returns the stored result or Unknown
  Note over Fx: reconcile_cancelled runs every second and releases only CancelledBeforeDispatch reservations
